   <media:thumbnail url="https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/0kO6xd77cAQ/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Le Smoking, 60 Years of an Icon

Introduced by Yves Saint Laurent in 1966, Le Smoking redefined the codes of modern elegance. A radical expression of femininity, power and independence that challenged conventions. Worn and reinterpreted across generations, its power and allure remain unchanged.

Anok Yai, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Rosé, Zoë Kravitz, Anja Rubik, Kate Moss, Charli XCX, Frankie Rayder &amp; Loli Bahia, alongside Rauw Alejandro, Connor Storrie, CORTIS MARTIN, CORTIS JAMES, Chen Zheyuan &amp; Kento Yamazaki.

Directed by Dani Aphrodite

Discover more on https://bit.ly/3WOscfy

#YSL #YvesSaintLaurent #SaintLaurent</media:description>
